abstract: >-
  Standard-library Python implementation of exact rational gap recurrences,
  dihedral symmetry reduction, capacity-bracelet counts, direct continuous
  simulation, and conditional gap simulation for greedy online facility
  assignment on unit-edge cycles with uniform capacity. Accompanies the paper
  Multi-Capacity Greedy Online Facility Assignment on Cycles: Exact Gap
  Recurrences and Symmetry-Reduced Algorithms, accepted at ICAA 2027.
keywords:
  - online facility assignment
  - exact dynamic programming
  - cycle metrics
  - dihedral symmetry
  - Rao-Blackwellization
